          "name": "StrongPity",
          "vendor": "MITRE ATT&CK",
          "scope": "overlapping",
          "confidence": "high",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "source--mitre-attack-19-2"
          ],
          "analyst_notes": "MITRE ATT&CK lists StrongPity as an Associated Group for G0056, but also states that the name has been used for both the group and its malware. It is therefore retained as an overlapping actor name, not as an exact software-to-actor identity assertion."
        }
      ],
